      "content": "It's essential to consult your doctor about your concerns, especially considering the potential interactions between hyperthyroidism and ADHD medication. Taking Adderall while having an overactive thyroid may worsen ADHD symptoms and cause increased heart palpitations. Your doctor can assess your situation and recommend adjustments to your medication or dosage to manage both conditions effectively. They may also consider alternative medication options for ADHD or monitoring your thyroid levels more closely. In the meantime, try to manage your symptoms by staying hydrated and getting enough rest.",
