      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that i should talk to my doctor but they're super busy and i can't get an appointment for like two weeks. i really cant afford to fall behind on my work deadlines because of the brain fog. \n\nif i just take a slightly smaller dose, like half of what i usually take, would that be a safe way to handle the jitters until i can see them? or is there a specific way i should time it with my thyroid meds so they don't clash so hard?",
